    "title": "sportsYou",
    "description": "sportsYou is a robust, US-owned and operated messaging and media platform built with Coaches to elevate Team Culture.\r\n\r\nWe provide a data-secure, school-safe environment that promotes accountability and enriches youth sports communities to help young Athletes find their stride \u2013  in sports and life. \r\n\r\nWe empower Coaches to contact Athletes and Families in real time without having to share personal emails or phone numbers.\r\n\r\nWe enable ADs to get a holistic picture of all their teams\u2019 activity, efficiently segment by season, create Captains groups, and more.\r\n\r\nWe provide Athletes, Parents, and Team Photographers the space to share the magic moments they capture. \r\nsY is frictionless to set up and we will never sell your data.\r\n\r\nBecause to us, You aren\u2019t users \u2013 You\u2019re Teammates.\r\n\r\nCALENDAR brings transparency to all Team activity with the ability to update schedules and share locations through Google Maps.\r\n\r\nPOSTS let you make announcements, share content, and engage with all.\r\n\r\nCHAT enables real-time communication with an entire team or selected groups. \r\n\r\nTEAMS let you huddle up in seconds with unlimited Teammates.\r\n\r\nFILES give you a centralized library to store and share important docs.\r\n\r\nMEDIA provides a dynamic gallery for all the pics and vids captured of the Team doing their thing.\r\n\r\nsportsYou is ready for a tryout.\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ll be the best Teammate you ever had.",
